# LAUNCH-02 · Container build context allowlist (API and worker images; see Dockerfile).
# Everything is excluded, then only the workspace the API and worker need is re-included.
# Secrets (.env*), local tooling state, the marketing site and docs never enter the image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps
!packages
!db
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
